        }
        DESCRIPTION "Story Hook: In searching for an apprentice, the magus discovers a Gifted child in the heart of the Jewish community. Does the community allow the child to be taken? What assurances can the magus make as to his religious well-being? If the magus takes him without consent, how does the community respond?"
    }

}
